      "The BizApps Issues Application — brings first-class Issue Tracking, Triage boards,",
      "and SLA monitoring into MemberJunction Explorer.",
      "",
      "DefaultNavItems represents the four core views:",
      "1. Issues (Kanban, List, Severity matrix with status KPIs and filters)",
      "2. My Issues (User-reported and user-assigned issues)",
      "3. Triage & SLAs (Defect escalation and response speed tracking)",
      "4. Types & Workflows (Issue types and routing configuration)",
